sequenceDiagram
    participant harness as Harness
    participant collector as Collector
    participant android as Android node
    harness->>collector: node_click with private handle
    collector->>collector: Consume the single-use handle
    collector->>android: Refresh the original node once
    android-->>collector: Current node attributes
    collector->>collector: Check identity, visibility and click support
    alt Valid node and matching attributes
        collector->>android: performAction ACTION_CLICK
        android-->>collector: Return value or exception
        collector-->>harness: Node result and execution record
    else Obsolete or unavailable target
        collector-->>harness: Return reason, no old-coordinate fallback
    end
